    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "THREE-BEDROOM BUNGALOW IN AN EXCELLENT LOCATION, JUST A FEW MINUTES’ WALK FROM LONGFORD TOWN CENTRE.\r\n\r\nDavis Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market, this quaint three-bedroom bungalow, in a most sought-after location, within easy walking distance of Longford town centre and Longford Cathedral. 39 College Park, just off the Ballinalee Road is a unique, charming place to live and is hugely attractive to first-time buyers, as a retirement home, or as an investment property. Bungalows in and around the Longford Town area are incredibly scarce, with a big demand, so we expect this one to be hugely popular.\r\n\r\nThe neatly appointed accommodation comprises of a kitchen-dining room, sitting room, sunroom, three bedrooms and a family bathroom. A feature of this well-presented home is the garage to the rear, as well as garden shed, while the property also boast oil fired central heating, solid fuel stove, as well as double glazed windows and doors. \r\n\r\nSituated at the end of a cul de sac in a much desired development, the property has the benefit of no through traffic, with The Cathedral, The Camlin River and The Albert Reynolds Peace Park (The Mall Recreational Complex) just a few minutes’ walk away.\r\n\r\nLidl & Dunnes supermarkets, service stations, as well as all the town centre amenities, are all within a short walking distance.\r\n\r\nViewing of this fine bungalow is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nPlease contact us on 043 3350555 to arrange your viewing, or call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N39 F9W7"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: 3.65m x 1.70m\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: 3.00m x 7.60m\r\n\r\nSitting room: 4.10m x 3.40m\r\n\r\nSunroom: 2.55 x 3.85m\r\n\r\nBed 1: 3.05m x 3.15m\r\n\r\nBed 2: 3.55m x 3.10m\r\n\r\nBed 3: 3.00m x 3.20m\r\n\r\nBathroom: 3.10m x 1.80m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Albert Reynolds Peace Park (The Mall Recreational Complex) & Swimming Pool- 5 minute walk \r\n\r\nGarden Shed and Garage\r\n\r\nPatio area leading from sunroom\r\n\r\nFitted Wardrobes in bedrooms\r\n\r\nTimber ceilings in kitchen, sunroom, hall and bathroom\r\n\r\nPvc windows and doors\r\n\r\nOff street parking\r\n\r\nSolid Fuel Stove with back boiler\r\n\r\nOil fired central heating\r\n\r\n15-minute walk to the Train & Bus Station\r\n\r\nNational & Secondary Schools- few minutes’ walk\r\n\r\nWalking distance to The Cathedral, Lidl, Dunnes Stores & Applegreen\r\n\r\nLongford Golf Club 5-minute drive\r\n\r\nMains Water and sewerage"
      },
